ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786726455618236001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"be1edf10-b73d-4250-a018-c50e978c96f0","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"f96b-3498-8f04-40b0"}],"description":"## Context\nFollow-up to winning-endurant-xenops. Before the fold defer-guard lands, any fold that crossed an un-cited pre-snapshot orphan LAUNDERED it: the event file was retired and its uuid cited in source_event_uuids without its effect entering the compiled state. fsck reports clean on such tickets. The data is NOT lost — retired files are preserved and rebuild_snapshot_from_full_log replays the full log including .retired — but there is no DETECTION: finding historical laundering requires comparing each ticket's snapshot-compiled state against a full-log replay (expensive, so an opt-in deep check, e.g. fsck --deep or --verify-snapshots).\n## Proposed direction\nOpt-in fsck deep verification: for each ticket with a snapshot, replay full log (incl .retired) and diff against snapshot-compiled state; mismatch => LAUNDERED_SNAPSHOT finding routed to the existing rebuild door. Known live incidents: one (e27c orphan, healed pre-fold) — historical damage believed bounded.\n## Out of scope\nThe forward-path defer guard (xenops).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"f75afd03-cd4f-491d-9fdf-28e59a993011","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"idea","tags":[],"ticket_id":"2aaf-90b9-4a31-43bf","ticket_type":"task","title":"fsck deep check: detect historically laundered snapshots (cited-but-effect-missing)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["44a9808e-91b8-4bee-91f1-f178b8b80048","be1edf10-b73d-4250-a018-c50e978c96f0","f75afd03-cd4f-491d-9fdf-28e59a993011"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786731437554769131,"uuid":"212491f0-b2ab-475f-a9ed-6fa93684542e"}